🥊 Google = select,🔰 Proxy,🤏 Manual,🤏 Manual A,🤏 Manual B,🔥 Auto,🇺🇲 United States,🇭🇰 Hong Kong,🇨🇳 Taiwan,🇸🇬 Singapore,🇯🇵 Japan,🇰🇷 Korea,🥬 Experimental,😓 Cheap,policy-regex-filter=.*
🤮 Instagram = select,🔰 Proxy,🤏 Manual,🤏 Manual A,🤏 Manual B,🔥 Auto,🇺🇲 United States,🇭🇰 Hong Kong,🇨🇳 Taiwan,🇸🇬 Singapore,🇯🇵 Japan,🇰🇷 Korea,🥬 Experimental,😓 Cheap,policy-regex-filter=.*
🧠 OpenAI = select,🔰 Proxy,🤏 Manual,🤏 Manual A,🤏 Manual B,🔥 Auto,🇺🇲 United States,🇭🇰 Hong Kong,🇨🇳 Taiwan,🇸🇬 Singapore,🇯🇵 Japan,🇰🇷 Korea,🥬 Experimental,😓 Cheap,policy-regex-filter=.*
